[Music]  and no way home grossed an incredible  1.9 billion dollars at the global box  office and ranks among the best mcu  films ever among fans and critics very  soon sony could even reach the 2 billion  us dollar mark an extended version will  be released in theaters as has been  known for a short time it is called the  more fun stuff version and is expected  to contain some bonus scenes that were  not shown in the previous theatrical  version sony now communicated the  official release date via the official  twitter channel of no way home thus the  us cinema release is scheduled for  september 1st 2022 a similar approach  was taken with avengers endgame where a  longer version was also released in  theaters a few months after the actual  theatrical release are you going to  watch the movie again as an extended cut  or are you reluctant to support disney's  practice do not hesitate to tell us in  the comments down below  a couple of weeks ago we got some  initial information about the upcoming  the hunger games the ballad of songbirds  and snakes the movie adaptation is set  up as a prequel and thus tells the  backstory of the hunger games films with  jennifer lawrence we will see 21 year  old golden globes winner rachel zegler  in the starring role she plays district  12 tribute lucy gray bear and her mentor  is none other than corey lana snow who  is already well known as the dictatorial  president from the previous movies in  the prequel he is still an adolescent  but already determined to lead his  tribute to victory in the 10th hunger  games as deadline now reports there will  be a new cast member who is not unknown  in the fantasy genre the talk is of  peter dinklage who became famous for the  role of tyrion lannister in game of  thrones rumor has it that he will take  on the role of kaska highbottom who is  the dean of the academy he therefore  plays a key role in the prequel since as  the dean he wields an immense amount of  power and is clearly superior to corey  elena snow in terms of hierarchy we  believe dinklage is definitely capable  of playing this role after all he has  already proven in game of thrones that  he knows exactly how to play cunning  powerful men we are eagerly awaiting his  appearance though an official  confirmation is still pending francis  lawrence who is already known as the  director of the previous films will  direct the ballad of songbirds and  snakes the screenplay was written by toy  story 3 author michael arndt hunger  games veteran nina jacobson as well as  suzanne collins the author of the book  series who work as producers  nevertheless there is still more than a  year to go before the movie hits  theaters as it is scheduled for release  on november 17 2023  just recently we reported that the  pre-production of dune part 2 has been  running since the beginning of the month  as the responsible parties announced  last monday via twitter the real  shooting with the actors has now begun  among the cast of the sequel are of  course timothy chalamet as paula tritus  and zendaya in her growing role as chani  as well as black widow actress florence  pugh as princess erilan there are  already first unofficial set photos of  pew which show her in a princess gown in  addition to the three young actors the  cast includes christopher walken as  emperor chatham iv stellen skarsgard is  baron harkonnen javier bardem is stilgar  and rebecca ferguson is lady jessica a  brand new addition to the cast by the  way is suhaila yakub who joined just a  few days ago and plays the freeman  leader shashakli the plot picks up  directly where the previous movie left  off the focus is this primarily on paul  and chani who must reunite against their  opponents behind the camera of dune 2  everything remains the same since  director denis villeneuve has put  together exactly the same team as for  the six-time oscar-winning predecessor  this means that at least on the  technical side nothing should go awry we  are very excited about dune part 2 and  look forward to its theatrical release  on november 17 2023  wolverine is one of hugh jackman's most  successful movies and also one of the  most popular marvel characters of the  last decade jackman made his last  appearance as wolverine in logan in 2017  and since then it has been uncertain  what the future of the character will be  a new casting has been under discussion  for a number of weeks now and will  probably involve rocketman actor taran  egerton in an interview with the new  york times egerton confirmed that he is  currently in negotiations with marvel  and kevin feig and then he himself is  hoping for the opportunity to play  wolverine he also had some words to  share about hugh jackman he was  concerned he might not be able to keep  up with jackman who gave the character  of wolverine a great amount of  recognition the agreement between  eggerton and marvel is therefore not a  done deal as he himself emphasized in a  recent conversation with andy cohen  there eggerton attempted to somewhat  qualify his statements from the past as  nothing has been decided yet however if  egerton were to be cast as the new  wolverine he would certainly not think  twice about accepting the offer what are  your thoughts on the casting would it  work for the kingsman actor to take over  the role of wolverine or would you  prefer somebody else to play the part  let us know in the comments  the planned the boy spin-off has been  the talk of the town for a few weeks now  after the launch of the long waited  third season it is all the more fitting  that the official title of the upcoming  series has now been revealed the  spin-off will be called gen v whereas  previously everything pointed to the  title varsity generation v refers to the  drug compound v which lends the  superheroes their powers as you can tell  from the synopsis gen v is taking place  at vaude international's superhero  college which is the only one of its  kind in the us moreover the series is  said to be r-rated and will test the  physical sexual and moral limits of the  college soups together they are to  compete for the best deals in the top  cities the r rating in particular is  great news as it also puts the spin-off  on par with the main series which  likewise received the infamous r rating  on the other hand it would also be  rather reckless if they were to dial it  down a notch in terms of violence and  humor after all that's exactly what  makes the boys stand out a further clue  from those responsible also gives a  direct idea of the direction in which  gen v is heading for the atmosphere  supposed to be like a hybrid of the  hunger games and a college series in the  course of the series we can also hope  for a meeting of the college soups with  the superheroes from the main series the  crossover was recently confirmed by  producer eric kripke in an interview  with deadline so far the young actors  patrick schwarzenegger marco pogozi liz  broadway and london thor have joined the  cast to name a few we are definitely  interested in the new series and look  forward to more information about gen v  the competition in the streaming  business is extremely tough and so the  respective providers must always try to  surpass others while amazon has had a  respectable streaming catalog for a long  time the visual presentation has clearly  been lacking no matter if via tablet  computer or gaming console the overview  was always amazon's biggest drawback  compared to disney plus or netflix after  many years the people in charge seem to  have finally realized this as has now  been announced the interface will be  completely revamped the horizontal menu  at the top of the screen will now move  to the left side just as we are used to  from other providers in addition the  thumbnails will be given more space  there will be more preview images and a  blue check mark will make it easier to  see which content is available for free  and which ones are subject to a fee  there are many more features that will  be released gradually on smart tvs  android and fire tvs in the coming weeks  all other devices will receive the  update at a later date unfortunately it  remains to be seen how good the update  really is at the end of the day and  whether they managed to redesign the  confusing layout satisfactorily  we have known about disney's upcoming  lilo and stitch film remake since 2018  however not a lot has happened in the  past four years this might now gradually  change because as coming soon reports a  director has meanwhile been found the  talk is of newcomer dean fleisher camp  who receives some critical acclaim with  the bizarre film marcel the shell with  shoes on he thus takes over from crazy  rich asians director john m chu who was  originally in talks to direct the movie  the scriptwriter is not officially known  yet but disney is set to be in final  talks with chris kt bright who is part  of the extended crew of 2016's moana  apart from that however he is still  quite a dark horse in hollywood the  original movie of the same name lilo and  stitch dates back to 2002 and was a huge  hit for disney at the time the story  revolves around a lonely hawaiian girl  named lilo who happens to encounter the  aggressive little creature stitch one  day stitch escaped from a cruel  experiment on the planet turo and soon  wins lilo's heart at the same time  however she is unaware of stitch's  destructive powers disney has not yet  given a release date for the remake but  we will keep you up to date  that was our news for this week feel  free to watch our new original on  transformers rise of the beasts on our  channel where we give you an exciting  overview of the next installment of one  of your favorite franchises also the new  trailer for halloween ends was recently  released and you should definitely check  it out  [Music]

